on: there is none yet, but we can say \"Given the facts we have, I propose...\" That's okay.\n\nWe must include explicit facts: 100% reliable, makes correct decisions quickly, creates positive atmosphere. Also mention concerns: difficulty communicating ideas, egocentric, not willing to further education.\n\nExplain why still choose C: reliability and decision quality outweigh communication concerns, and positive crew atmosphere suggests cooperation.\n\nVote: Candidate C.\n\nNow produce output."}
